# Avatar of Burgeoning Echoes: "Landfall -- Whenever a land you control enters, empower Jace 2" and "Planeswalkers you control
# have '[-10]: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each land you control.'"
# Bot1 plays Islands on turns 1, 3 and 5: each landfall empowers Jace 2 (the first makes the Jace token), so it has 2, 4 and 6.
# Bot2's Islands (turns 2 and 4) are not "a land you control", so the token stays at 4 through them. On turn 5 Jace's Machinations
# adds 8 (14), and the token's granted -10 targets the Avatar: three lands are counted as the ability resolves, so three counters
# (the Avatar is a 5/6) and the token is left with 4 loyalty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Avatar of Burgeoning Echoes
Island
Island
Black Lotus
Island
Jace's Machinations
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x25

